        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By using vendors, we are able to drop-ship products directly to our customers’ sites, which improves working capital turnover, quality and inventory management.",
        "start_character": 18784,
        "end_character": 18944
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We devote resources to research and development (“R&D”) with the objective of developing innovative new products and services that enhance system performance, improve product reliability, reduce product cost and simplify installation.",
        "start_character": 19645,
        "end_character": 19879
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage open issues via our customer relationship management system in order to monitor service, track closure of all customer issues and further improve our customer service in every region in which we sell our products.",
        "start_character": 15495,
        "end_character": 15718
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer our customers engineering expertise to design and deliver the optimal solution for each unique project, including installation training services and dedicated project management to provide comprehensive technical support.",
        "start_character": 14761,
        "end_character": 14991
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell our products to solar developers, independent power producers, utilities, and EPCs that build solar energy projects, often under master supply agreements or multi-year procurement contracts.",
        "start_character": 4930,
        "end_character": 5128
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we have historically maintained certain levels of supplies and inventories manufactured by outside vendors, we have the capability to manufacture internally some of these products at our principal manufacturing facility located in Albuquerque, New Mexico.",
        "start_character": 18945,
        "end_character": 19206
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our acquisition of Soluciones Técnicas Integrales Norland, S.L.U., a Spanish private limited liability company, and its subsidiaries (collectively, “STI”) in January 2022, we added a dual-row tracker design to our product portfolio.",
        "start_character": 2140,
        "end_character": 2377
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In May 2024, we entered into a triple-net lease for a new manufacturing and office facility located in Bernalillo County, New Mexico, which includes approximately 176,000 square feet of manufacturing space and approximately 40,000 square feet of office and laboratory space.",
        "start_character": 17647,
        "end_character": 17921
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, during the second quarter of 2024, we concluded that certain parts manufactured by the Company qualify for the section 45X advanced production credits.",
        "start_character": 33416,
        "end_character": 33580
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we support external development and verification programs as well as offer education reimbursement.",
        "start_character": 36267,
        "end_character": 36379
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In the U.S., we operate an approximately 283,000 square foot manufacturing facility in Albuquerque, New Mexico.",
        "start_character": 16885,
        "end_character": 16996
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001820721-26-000008",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001820721-26-000008-750ba1ffe6b6fbad",
        "accession_number": "0001820721-26-000008",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Internationally, with our STI Operations reporting segment, we have approximately 67,000 and 610,000 square feet of manufacturing and warehouse facilities in Spain and Brazil, respectively.",
